  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the\n• boil. Cut the corn cob in half. Slice the tomato into\n• thick rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-1b585b24.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook the corn in the boiling water until tender and\n• bright yellow, 5 minutes. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-e050cc7f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice the haloumi horizontally to get 1 thin piece\n• per burger bun and pat dry. On a plate, combine\n• the haloumi, Nan's special seasoning and a\n• drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-fc82e27c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan to a medium-high heat\n• with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook the haloumi until\n• golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a\n• plate lined with a paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-14648aef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave the bake-at-home burger buns on a\n• plate for 1 minute. Halve the buns and toast in the\n• frying pan over a medium-high heat until golden,\n• 2-3 minutes.\n• TIP: If you don't have a microwave, you can bake\n• the buns straight on the wire rack at 180°C/160°C\n• fan-forced for 3 minutes, or until heated through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-6fe758b9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build your burgers by spreading a layer of tartare\n• sauce over the base of a bun. Top with a handful\n• of the deluxe salad leaves, tomato and spiced\n• haloumi. Dress the remaining salad leaves with\n• ranch dressing. Serve the burgers with the corn\n• cobs (spread with a little butter if you like!) and\n• the salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075269e0f601846c30f9d2f/step-e8af3fb8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
